<title>USA: Kokomo-Center SBC, Ind., $10 mln won by Betzold.</title>
<headline>Kokomo-Center SBC, Ind., $10 mln won by Betzold.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Betzold, Berg &amp; Nussbaum Inc., said it won $10 million of Kokomo-Center Schools Building Corp., Ind., First mortgage lease rental revenue bonds, Seris 1997, with a net interest cost of 5.3606 percent.</p>
</text>
